<!-- @opening -->
<p class="story-lead">An automation reports zero crashes because its required query produced no usable evidence. The next promotion would turn a data-quality failure into wider user exposure.</p>

<!-- @before 5. Multi-Signal Release Gate :: animation -->
### Unknown is a decision state

